Hello Principal<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Here at the Red Cross we are always trying to find ways to increase the number of Donors to keep the blood supply safe and full.&nbsp; One way we are doing that this year is with the Leaders Save Lives Program.&nbsp; It is a Summer Program that students can do on their own.&nbsp; If you could possibly get this to guidance and/or the student body that would be very helpful for the Red Cross and the patients in need.<br />
